    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/0edeacd37c7bbed2ceac10e091087dfd.avif?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Planet Earth is coming to an end and is also suffering an alien attack.<br>The Retro Robots will help us fight them in the search for a habitable planet. Live an epic adventure fighting and traveling through different planets and gravities (42 missions).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/c1df185c377a018e427a6f35dcf85422.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Robots on Foot: <br>Choose your favorite Retro Robot and fight your enemies on foot. Jump, shoot, change weapons and robots, power ups, become a motorcycle or robot, fly with the Jet-Pack and have fun. Elevators and platforms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/4c95285001428a558131126bf31eac9a.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Jet-Pack:<br>If you take the Jet-Pack power up you can fly as long as it has fuel.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/3a1d251f863c017a90e6c66ec9875061.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Motorbike:<br>There are missions especially for motorcycles, especially fun, fast and frenetic. On planets with low gravity motorcycles fly, ha, ha, ha.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/5fae1f68953efbf26f7185038fe4a661.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Space Ship:<br>Combat missions against UFOs and alien fighters. Dodge the asteroids with red lines and push the ones with green lines. Rescue, search, mazes, balance and skill. Shoot and bomb.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/739258d1a84c90e9539f9ce56dd8330d.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Moon Car:<br>Its power, speed and jump vary depending on the planet we are on and its gravity. Destroy the enemy bikes, complete the mission before the timer reaches zero, run. Its functionality is very very fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/ec66e05456b00a0df165405f5f470631.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Planets &amp; Missions (42):<br>The Earth (Instrucction (7), war (7)), The Moon (1), Mothership Interior (1), Open Space (1), Mercury (2), Venus (1), Mars (2), Invaded City (3), Jupiter (3), Saturn (Rings (1), Surface (3)), Uranus (4) and Neptune (6). Until reaching the planet Green hope.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/6182a16b3853c6e741c918787a13e023.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Enemies:<br>Cannons, lasers, drones, robots, killer balls, harmful zones, UFOs, fighters, trucks, asteroids, aliens, traps, ... ...",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/0edeacd37c7bbed2ceac10e091087dfd.avif?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Planet Earth is coming to an end and is also suffering an alien attack.<br>The Retro Robots will help us fight them in the search for a habitable planet. Live an epic adventure fighting and traveling through different planets and gravities (42 missions).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/c1df185c377a018e427a6f35dcf85422.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Robots on Foot: <br>Choose your favorite Retro Robot and fight your enemies on foot. Jump, shoot, change weapons and robots, power ups, become a motorcycle or robot, fly with the Jet-Pack and have fun. Elevators and platforms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/4c95285001428a558131126bf31eac9a.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Jet-Pack:<br>If you take the Jet-Pack power up you can fly as long as it has fuel.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/3a1d251f863c017a90e6c66ec9875061.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Motorbike:<br>There are missions especially for motorcycles, especially fun, fast and frenetic. On planets with low gravity motorcycles fly, ha, ha, ha.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209300/extras/5fae1f68953efbf26f7185038fe4a661.webp?t=1728563885\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br>\u00b7 Space Ship:<br>Combat missions against UFOs and alien fighters. Dodge the asteroids wit